              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ShellInJetBundle"} (?)
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#FlowOfFieldHistoriesAlongEvolutionaryVectorField"}
              the statement is equivalently that the ordinary flow (prop.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CartanHomotopyFormula"}
